@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Registro correcto
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Registro con datos inválidos (espera 400)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "email": "no-es-un-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login correcto
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login con clave incorrecta (espera 401)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Perfil con token (espera 200)
GET {{base}}/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Perfil sin token (espera 401)
GET {{base}}/perfil